\custom degree=note _element=div _classes=.note _endString=END
\custom angle=poem _element=div _classes=.poem _endString=«POEM
\custom single=tab _element=div _classes=.table _endString=------

!! Custom `_endString` per pragma

Three pragmas at the top register three symbols, each with a different `_endString` literal.

!!! Word terminator `END`

°note Some note
that spans
multiple lines
END

Trailing paragraph below.

!!! Symbol terminator `«POEM`

»poem A poem,
two short lines.
«POEM

Trailing paragraph below.

!!! Dash terminator `------`

›tab table body line 1
table body line 2
------

Trailing paragraph below.